# Changelog

## [1.2.0] - 2026-10-01

### Added
- `--detect-modulation` CLI option (requires `--detect-key`) reporting key modulation over time
- Performance Benchmarks section in the READMEs and `examples/benchmark_table.py` to reproduce it

### Changed
- Python 3.12 or newer is now required; dependency minimums raised, including `librosa>=1.0.0`
- Installation and Docker image build from lockfiles; the Docker image uses Python 3.14
- Auto-parallel mode falls back to sequential analysis when CPU or memory is saturated, and caps its memory limit at available memory
- Importing the package no longer imports the CLI module

### Fixed
- BPM detection always fell back to the deprecated `librosa.beat.tempo` because the check for the newer API looked up `librosa.feature.rhythm`, which librosa does not expose; it now calls `librosa.feature.tempo` directly, fixing `module 'librosa.beat' has no attribute 'tempo'` with librosa 1.0
- Tempo read from array results of `beat_track` instead of falling back to 120 BPM
- Modulation detection mixing beat frames and seconds, and beat frames not matching the chroma grid
- Chord analysis dropping the final partial window; overlapping chord intervals; Roman numerals for flat roots and `maj7` chords in minor keys
- Structure analysis edge cases: empty inputs, terminal boundary, nested section energy, similarity weighting
- Spectral contrast at low sample rates, melody interval categories and vibrato rate
- Thread safety of the system monitor, performance profiler and progress manager
- Parallel process workers pickling the analyzer and its monitor thread
- SIGINT handler now restored after the CLI exits

## [1.1.0] - 2025-11-01

### Added
- Advanced audio analysis modules (chord, structure, rhythm, timbre, melody, dynamics)
- Selective analysis options for faster targeted analysis
- Quiet option for CLI with test coverage
- Progress bar accuracy and user experience improvements

### Changed
- Improved accuracy of audio analysis modules
- Enhanced key/chord detection with drop chorus logic
- Major codebase improvements with enhanced tooling and testing
- Updated package dependencies

### Fixed
- CI test failures resolved
- BPM selection bug
- Progress bar update issues
- Audio analysis accuracy and stability improvements
- Noise audio confidence threshold in key detector test
- Coverage configuration to report correct metrics (85%)
- Unused global lint errors

### Documentation
- Fixed typos in README files
- Updated progress flag usage documentation
- Clarified commit and branch rules

### Development
- Configured black formatter and fixed lint issues
- Applied black and isort formatting

## [1.0.0] - 2025-05-29

### Added
- Initial release
- BPM (tempo) detection from audio files
- Musical key detection
- Command-line interface for audio analysis
